      "summary_html": "<p>AI slop shifts the burden of thinking from the person producing the work to whoever receives it. In this Operators\u2019 Cut, Nufar Gaspar joins NLW to share practical habits for creating better work with AI, from developing your own point of view and teaching models your taste to building effective review checkpoints. NLW also breaks down how he uses AI to produce How We Got Here while keeping control of its perspective and narrative.</p><p><strong>Check out How We Got Here Ep. 2 - How We Made the Wrong Things Cheap </strong></p><p><a href=\"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/how-we-got-here-with-nlw/id6822359990\">\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/how-we-got-here-with-nlw/id6822359990\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060</a></p><p><a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/show/7h55KSq0XwIjdWzwF2zgNV?si=cb76360051ec48a0\">\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060https://open.spotify.com/show/7h55KSq0XwIjdWzwF2zgNV?si=cb76360051ec48a0\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060</a></p><p><strong>Learn More about the AI Champions Program: </strong><a href=\"https://www.besuper.ai/champions\">\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060https://www.besuper.ai/champions\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060</a></p><p><strong>Brought to you by:</strong></p><p><strong>KPMG</strong> \u2013 New KPMG and UT Austin research shows what separates \u201cAI Amplifiers\u201d from everyone else. Learn more at <a href=\"https://kpmg.com/us/en/articles/2026/ai-redefining-career-success-empower-your-talent-thrive.html?utm_source=the_ai_daily_brief&amp;utm_medium=native&amp;utm_content=podcast&amp;utm_campaign=701dV00000aMKrPQAW&amp;cid=701dV00000aMKrPQAW\">\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060kpmg.com/us/AIamplifiers\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u